@startuml uc_005_conflict
!include common/uc_styles.puml

title **UC-005 — Conflict Resolution**\n(Bounded Context: Conflict)

left to right direction

actor "Regulatory\nOfficial" as RO #E3F2FD

rectangle "Selma Application" as SYS {
  rectangle "Conflict Resolution\n(conflict_resolver)" as BOUNDED {

    usecase "Detect Conflict"                as UC1
    usecase "Resolve Conflict\n(deterministic)" as UC2
    usecase "Escalate to\nHuman Review"      as UC3
    usecase "Review Conflict\nArtifact"      as UC4
  }
}

' ---- associations ----
RO --> UC4

UC1 ..> UC2 : <<include>>
UC2 ..> UC3 : <<extend>>
UC3 ..> UC4 : <<include>>

' ---- notes ----
note right of UC1
  **Pre:** Multiple directives or rules overlap
  on the same target scope
  **Post:** Conflict artifact created
  **Contract:** conflict/detection.yaml (CD-001, CD-002)
end note

note right of UC2
  **Pre:** Conflict detected, strategy available
  **Post:** Conflict resolved via deterministic
  precedence rules; resolution recorded
  **Contract:** conflict/precedence.yaml
end note

note bottom of UC3
  **Pre:** Deterministic resolution not possible
  or confidence below threshold
  **Post:** Conflict escalated; Regulatory
  Official notified for manual review
  **Contract:** conflict/precedence.yaml (step 3)
end note

@enduml
